  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match the List I with List II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><strong>List I</strong></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><strong>List II</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td>Intrinsic Semiconductor</td>\t\t\t<td>I</td>\t\t\t<td>Fermi-level near valence band</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td>n-type semiconductor</td>\t\t\t<td>II</td>\t\t\t<td>Fermi-level at middle of valence and conduction band</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td>p-type semiconductor</td>\t\t\t<td>III</td>\t\t\t<td>Fermi-level near conduction band</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td>Metals</td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td>Fermi-level inside conduction band</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>"
  },
